## Day 6

### Achievement

Built IAM Rule Engine with multiple rules.

Rules:

- Role contains Admin
- Role contains Superuser
- Role contains Controller

### Workflow

Google Sheets
↓
IF Rule Engine
↓
True Branch: High Risk Users
↓
Aggregate
↓
Basic LLM Chain
↓
OpenAI

### Result

Filtered 5 users down to 3 risk-related users.

Only high-risk records were sent to OpenAI.

Token usage: ~535 tokens.

### Key Learning

Rule Engine should detect risk records first.

AI should explain the risk and generate the audit report.

This reduces cost and improves scalability.
